  const orderedWorkers=qualified.slice().sort((a,b)=>{const ak=a._mgmtKind==='owner'?0:a._mgmtKind==='permanent'?1:2,bk=b._mgmtKind==='owner'?0:b._mgmtKind==='permanent'?1:2;return ak-bk||(Number(b.skill)||0)-(Number(a.skill)||0)});
  for(const w of orderedWorkers){if(allocated>=need-.001)break;const raw=managementWorkerAvailableHours(w,startAt,it.endAt,8),free=Math.max(0,raw-(used[w.id]||0));if(free<=.001){if(raw>0&&used[w.id]>0)conflicted.push(w.name||w.id);continue}const take=Math.min(free,need-allocated,horizon-allocated);if(take<=0)continue;allocated+=take;used[w.id]=(used[w.id]||0)+take;(assignments[w.id]||(assignments[w.id]=[])).push({id:it.id,label:it.label,hours:take,priority:it.priority,endAt:it.endAt});if(w._mgmtKind==='seasonal')seasonal+=take;else if(w._mgmtKind==='owner')ownerH+=take;else permanent+=take;}
